    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 1 — Tarot Mage</strong></p><p><strong>“The future is rude. I read it anyway.”</strong></p><p>You are not powerful yet. You are noticeable. The cards do not obey you, but they do answer — and that is already enough to make normal people uncomfortable.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Insight</strong> or <strong>Occult</strong> (GM or player choice if one is already covered elsewhere)</li><li>1/Soma Break, before making an attribute check, you may draw the line of fate early and gain <strong>Advantage</strong> on that check</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Strategic Turn, before a faction Intrigue-forward action, you may <strong>read the spread</strong>: gain <strong>+2 to one relevant Intrigue OP roll</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> once you start consulting fate, you begin seeing patterns everywhere. Expect second-guessing, omen pressure, or trouble distinguishing signal from appetite.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"tarotT1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Draw the Line (Tactical)</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (before check) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Before an attribute check, reroll the lowest die on it.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
